   <crs:Description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Kodak Double-X - Black &amp; white film approximation. ISO 250. Film-noir and cinematic portraits. Box speed 250 (daylight). Visual approximation built from Lightroom sliders; not an exact reproduction.</rdf:li>
